WEBVTT

00:18.830 --> 00:22.530
<i>Gokusen</i>

00:22.800 --> 00:28.040
<i>How long has it been</i>
<i>since that day when we first met?</i>

00:28.210 --> 00:33.740
<i>So many good times and bad times</i>
<i>have come and gone since then.</i>

00:33.910 --> 00:39.080
<i>I know you can't make sense</i>
<i>of what I'm trying to say.</i>

00:39.250 --> 00:44.520
<i>But my true feelings for you</i>
<i>can never be put into words.</i>

00:44.820 --> 00:50.260
<i>Will you ever know how I feel?</i>
<i>Will you know what's going on inside me?</i>

00:50.460 --> 00:55.900
<i>If only we could live in a world where</i>
<i>you only have to be yourself and smile.</i>

00:56.070 --> 01:01.340
<i>Or is it always going to be like this?</i>
<i>Will we be able to go on like this?</i>

01:01.540 --> 01:09.240
<i>Even if you're far away, I want to</i>
<i>feel you in my heart, close to me.</i>

01:27.570 --> 01:28.190
Hmm?

01:28.500 --> 01:30.970
Well, well, nothing like a good fight.

01:32.570 --> 01:34.200
I'll just take a seat here.

01:34.270 --> 01:36.970
Ahh, to be young again!

01:37.510 --> 01:40.610
Although these two aren't
exactly pretty...

01:40.950 --> 01:42.810
Ugh! I can hardly bear to watch.

01:42.920 --> 01:46.850
If only I could move the way
I did in my youth...

01:46.990 --> 01:48.350
Tetsu! Minoru!

01:48.720 --> 01:50.550
You're slouching again, for chrissake!

01:50.660 --> 01:52.450
Ojou! Thank God you're here!

01:52.560 --> 01:53.650
O-Ojou!

01:53.760 --> 01:56.660
Hey, we were just fooling around, see...

01:56.860 --> 01:58.990
Come on, back to work now!

01:59.270 --> 02:00.730
Not so fast, boys!

02:01.730 --> 02:07.040
Listen, morons, there's no such thing as
"just fooling around" in a fight, got it?

02:07.210 --> 02:09.640
When a man and a woman fight,
it's the beginning of love...

02:09.740 --> 02:13.410
When two men fight it's life-or-death,
survival of the fittest!

02:13.810 --> 02:16.210
Oh crap, Ojou's on the warpath...

02:16.350 --> 02:17.040
I know.

02:19.850 --> 02:20.680
Come on.

02:20.790 --> 02:22.850
It's been a while since
I whipped you two into shape.

02:22.960 --> 02:24.010
Really, there's no need!

02:24.120 --> 02:26.620
We can't let you take time out
of your busy schedule to...

02:26.730 --> 02:28.990
I've gotten pretty rusty myself.

02:29.600 --> 02:30.590
Ya!

02:33.030 --> 02:34.520
Ha! Ha! Ha! Ha!

02:38.040 --> 02:40.130
Ojou, please don't...

02:45.410 --> 02:46.470
Ojou...

02:46.580 --> 02:51.070
You've certainly lived up to your name
as the Ooedo Clan's granddaughter...

02:51.180 --> 02:53.450
Sorry, I mean Acting Kumicho!

02:55.150 --> 02:59.520
But who would believe that Ojou
is actually a high school teacher?

02:59.630 --> 03:02.030
Surely even Buddha...

03:02.760 --> 03:05.960
...has no idea!

03:07.230 --> 03:11.970
<i>DUEL! SHIN VS. OJOU?</i>

03:15.510 --> 03:20.470
Kuma, are you sure you didn't see
who beat up on Kudoh and his buddies?

03:21.350 --> 03:23.940
Nope, 'cause I totally
blacked out, see...

03:24.050 --> 03:26.780
Yeah, but the only other person
there was Yamaguchi, right?

03:26.850 --> 03:27.480
Shin...

03:27.620 --> 03:29.780
Don't tell me you still
think it was Yankumi.

03:29.890 --> 03:31.220
How the hell could it be her?

03:31.660 --> 03:33.520
I don't see how it
could've been her, either.

03:33.630 --> 03:37.060
That bastard Kudoh's no wuss,
and it was three against one.

03:37.200 --> 03:38.160
Yeah, he's right.

03:38.260 --> 03:41.560
Hey, Yankumi's dog was there,
remember? It had to be him.

03:42.000 --> 03:43.330
Did you see any bite marks on them?

03:43.440 --> 03:45.060
Well, no, but still...

03:45.440 --> 03:47.570
Just shut the hell up, you prick!

03:47.670 --> 03:49.370
What did you call me, asshole?

03:49.540 --> 03:51.100
Hey, look! It's a fight!

03:52.240 --> 03:54.240
Come on! Hit that sucker! Hit him!

03:56.820 --> 03:58.840
You're such a loser, Sonomura.

03:58.980 --> 04:00.280
Goddammit!

04:02.050 --> 04:03.080
That's it!

04:03.190 --> 04:06.060
Hey, someone better keep
an eye out for the teacher.

04:06.160 --> 04:07.350
Well, actually...

04:07.590 --> 04:08.190
What, man?

04:08.290 --> 04:09.420
She's already here.

04:09.700 --> 04:12.160
Hey Sonomura, keep your hands up!
Your hands!

04:12.260 --> 04:14.760
Iida, sweep him for God's sake!

04:19.540 --> 04:21.600
What's the matter?
Still haven't had enough?

04:22.110 --> 04:23.340
Shit!

04:27.950 --> 04:29.040
Hey, Sonomura!

04:29.350 --> 04:30.410
Stop!

04:30.520 --> 04:31.480
That's enough.

04:31.850 --> 04:33.910
I'm calling the fight.
Time for class!

04:34.120 --> 04:34.990
Butt out, bitch!

04:37.990 --> 04:38.960
Ouch!

04:39.590 --> 04:41.120
That is not allowed, see?

04:42.900 --> 04:44.450
All right, time for class!

04:44.600 --> 04:46.430
Put those desks back where they belong!

04:49.070 --> 04:49.540
Okay.

04:49.640 --> 04:51.330
Today we're moving on to something new.

04:51.440 --> 04:54.460
You're going to learn how
to use quadratic functions.

04:55.270 --> 04:56.070
Hey Kuma...

04:56.180 --> 04:59.670
Go up there and hit Yamaguchi
on the back of the head.

04:59.780 --> 05:00.510
Huh?

05:00.610 --> 05:02.310
No way, man, not me!

05:02.420 --> 05:03.310
Just do it.

05:03.420 --> 05:07.220
Shin, why do you have such a
bug up your ass over Yankumi?

05:10.890 --> 05:14.380
Listen, even if she doesn't see
it coming, I bet she'll dodge you.

05:16.760 --> 05:19.600
Solve the parabolic function
when the vertices...

05:19.700 --> 05:21.430
...are (2,3) and (3,4).

05:22.130 --> 05:28.040
The formula to determine
the parabolic function...

05:28.210 --> 05:30.300
...is: Y=A.

05:32.510 --> 05:33.480
Ouch!

05:33.780 --> 05:35.510
Hey, what's the big idea? Shoot...

05:35.920 --> 05:39.350
Oh, hey, I'm sorry, man.

05:39.520 --> 05:40.850
That's not nice!

05:41.750 --> 05:42.520
Idiot!

05:42.990 --> 05:45.360
Where's your freakin' bloodlust?

05:46.690 --> 05:50.030
Come on, Shin, give it a rest, will you?

05:51.360 --> 05:53.530
Huh? You busting out, Shin?

05:53.730 --> 05:54.890
Wait for me!

05:55.230 --> 05:58.730
Hey, hey, what's the idea, skipping
out right under my nose like that?

05:58.840 --> 05:59.640
No way!

05:59.740 --> 06:03.640
You've got to stay today! Please!

06:03.880 --> 06:06.370
Jesus, what's the big deal?
Is there gonna be a test or something?

06:06.650 --> 06:08.940
Well, I guess you could say that...

06:09.080 --> 06:11.550
Except it's not you who's
getting tested, it's me...

06:11.880 --> 06:13.010
What's up with that?

06:13.150 --> 06:15.850
Well, you see, guys,
tomorrow's my evaluation class!

06:15.960 --> 06:17.390
Huh?

06:17.490 --> 06:18.650
You mean those classes...

06:18.760 --> 06:21.020
...where a whole bunch of
teacher jerks come in and watch?

06:21.160 --> 06:23.560
Right! You know, when teacher jerks
from other schools show up too!

06:23.660 --> 06:24.460
Damn!

06:24.560 --> 06:26.530
Yeah, well, you're just a rookie...

06:26.630 --> 06:29.690
Listen up, so you can
do your best tomorrow!

06:30.070 --> 06:33.200
Why don't you just tell us
the answers in advance?

06:33.440 --> 06:37.770
I thought of that, but I think
it's too risky, you know?

06:39.980 --> 06:40.670
Hey.

06:41.380 --> 06:43.850
Shin, you're not gonna
help her out, are you?

06:44.480 --> 06:45.610
Hell no!

06:46.320 --> 06:47.790
Minami, come here!

06:47.890 --> 06:48.380
What?

06:49.360 --> 06:50.190
Huh?

06:52.960 --> 06:53.690
Huh?

06:53.790 --> 06:55.090
Pass it on to everyone.

06:55.260 --> 06:56.130
You serious?

06:56.430 --> 07:00.870
Anyway, it's probably the most
important day of my life, so please...

07:01.370 --> 07:04.100
I don't know, don't you think
that's a little too cruel...

07:04.270 --> 07:05.470
I don't care, just pass it on!

07:05.570 --> 07:06.330
Gotcha!

07:12.610 --> 07:14.770
I really don't know about those guys...

07:14.880 --> 07:17.750
Those evaluation classes
can really get you down, huh?

07:18.150 --> 07:20.780
You've gone through it before, right?

07:21.020 --> 07:22.420
I was so nervous.

07:22.720 --> 07:26.420
I was more worried about the students'
behavior than what I was teaching.

07:26.660 --> 07:28.130
Right! Right!

07:28.460 --> 07:30.950
The night before,
I couldn't sleep a wink.

07:31.660 --> 07:33.660
I know what you mean!
I know what you mean!

07:34.900 --> 07:37.700
Ms. Yamaguchi,
I need your help with this.

07:37.840 --> 07:39.100
What is it?

07:39.410 --> 07:42.860
A list of the boys I want to
recruit for a club I'm starting.

07:43.140 --> 07:44.970
Oh, what kind of club?

07:45.380 --> 07:46.970
A boys' choir club.

07:47.610 --> 07:49.980
B-Boys' choir club?

07:50.080 --> 07:54.350
Springtime is coming,
springtime is coming...

07:54.450 --> 07:57.980
...where does springtime come?

07:58.560 --> 07:59.920
Well, now...

08:00.030 --> 08:01.990
That's a very bold venture
you're taking on...

08:02.190 --> 08:04.320
So these are the three
I want from Class 4.

08:04.600 --> 08:07.530
Hmm, so you think
these boys have talent, huh?

08:07.730 --> 08:09.900
Who said anything about talent?

08:10.040 --> 08:10.760
Huh?

08:11.270 --> 08:13.930
Sawada, Kinoshita and Hasegawa...

08:16.440 --> 08:17.210
Whoa!

08:17.340 --> 08:20.040
I guess she really goes
for the boy-toy look!

08:20.210 --> 08:22.410
I'd like to get these four from Class 3!

08:22.510 --> 08:23.380
Huh?

08:23.750 --> 08:28.050
Too bad I can't recruit a few straight-A
students for my class tomorrow!

08:29.390 --> 08:30.360
I'm home!

08:30.860 --> 08:33.120
Ojou, welcome home!

08:33.390 --> 08:36.730
I've just finished getting
your things ready for tomorrow!

08:36.830 --> 08:39.560
Oh, you mean you went
to pick up my stuff?

08:39.670 --> 08:41.460
Please, come this way...

08:43.170 --> 08:44.360
Here you are!

08:50.440 --> 08:54.240
We don't want those other
teachers dissing you, so I made...

08:54.350 --> 08:56.370
...an emergency trip to Kyoto!

08:56.620 --> 08:58.980
W-What...

09:00.120 --> 09:02.050
What the hell is this?

09:02.450 --> 09:04.920
I can't march into class tomorrow
in this get-up, for chrissake!

09:05.020 --> 09:06.460
But really, Ojou...

09:06.660 --> 09:07.490
Kyo-san!

09:07.590 --> 09:10.930
All I asked you to do was to pick up
my suit from the dry-cleaner's!

09:11.030 --> 09:12.760
But it's so katagi...

09:12.930 --> 09:14.730
Chump, that's my frickin' day job!

09:15.100 --> 09:17.570
And what's with this pig-sticker?

09:18.470 --> 09:22.000
That is the very blade that got me
through many a hard-fought battle...

09:22.140 --> 09:23.770
If push comes to shove, you can...

09:23.880 --> 09:26.810
Slash those teacher
bitches to ribbons, right?

09:27.810 --> 09:29.840
Fuhgeddaboutit!

09:31.120 --> 09:33.280
This isn't a turf war, Kyo-san!

09:33.390 --> 09:34.650
R-Right...

09:39.120 --> 09:40.250
Fuji!

09:40.930 --> 09:42.950
I'm surrounded by fools!

09:49.200 --> 09:50.670
Ms. Yamaguchi!

09:50.840 --> 09:51.900
Just relax!

09:52.270 --> 09:55.300
It's really no big deal.
Don't worry about it!

09:55.440 --> 09:56.270
Right...

09:56.440 --> 09:57.880
I beg to differ!

09:58.280 --> 10:03.410
One disgraced teacher can bring down
the entire school's reputation!

10:03.550 --> 10:05.070
I expect you to be flawless!

10:05.280 --> 10:06.650
Mr. Iwamoto!

10:07.020 --> 10:10.180
Go get some extra safety
helmets for our guests!

10:10.290 --> 10:11.090
Y-Yes, sir.

10:12.890 --> 10:16.850
If there's a student uprising,
at least we'll be prepared.

10:17.000 --> 10:20.090
You're the one tarnishing
the school's rep, dickhead!

10:29.210 --> 10:30.510
Ms. Yamaguchi!

10:30.610 --> 10:32.100
No need to be nervous!

10:32.440 --> 10:35.110
I'll be right there in the back
of the room, watching over you.

10:35.210 --> 10:36.610
Principal...

10:36.820 --> 10:39.790
I'm going to go meet
the visiting teachers now.

10:39.920 --> 10:43.120
Just be yourself and start teaching!

10:45.660 --> 10:46.350
All right!

10:47.290 --> 10:47.990
What?

10:53.170 --> 10:54.860
Hey! Yo! Principal!

10:55.100 --> 10:55.730
Huh?

10:55.870 --> 10:56.630
Yo?

10:57.270 --> 10:59.200
I need you to keep
them entertained for...

10:59.300 --> 11:01.570
...just ten minutes... no,
five minutes before you come in!

11:01.670 --> 11:03.270
A-All right.

11:03.980 --> 11:06.450
Those little shits!

11:07.080 --> 11:07.810
Yes.

11:07.910 --> 11:11.150
They'll be evaluating a rookie teacher
in charge of a major problem class.

11:11.250 --> 11:13.810
I'm positive
there will be some incident...

11:13.920 --> 11:17.450
I can guarantee you that the school's
reputation will take yet another hit...

11:17.660 --> 11:19.590
I'm counting on you...

11:19.690 --> 11:20.590
Yes, sir!

11:34.870 --> 11:36.640
W-What's this?

11:41.810 --> 11:46.650
I think I smell big trouble this time...

11:54.930 --> 11:55.550
Hey.

11:55.660 --> 11:57.430
Yankumi, you're early.

11:58.300 --> 11:59.420
You little...

12:01.600 --> 12:03.090
You guys! How could you do this to me?

12:03.170 --> 12:04.430
Go back to class.

12:04.700 --> 12:05.640
Well...

12:05.840 --> 12:07.360
What should we do?

12:11.780 --> 12:12.870
Oh, I see...

12:12.980 --> 12:13.970
He's behind this...

12:16.180 --> 12:17.170
Shin Sawada.

12:17.420 --> 12:19.720
I want you to tell everyone
to go back to class.

12:24.120 --> 12:24.890
All right.

12:27.030 --> 12:29.190
But only if you go
one-on-one with me.

12:29.760 --> 12:30.960
One-on-one?

12:32.160 --> 12:35.830
Oh please, you can't be serious!
With little ol' me?

12:36.030 --> 12:38.560
It was you who beat up on
Kudoh and his gang, wasn't it?

12:38.740 --> 12:39.430
Crap!

12:42.010 --> 12:45.910
If you promise to fight me, I'll tell
everyone to go back downstairs.

12:51.050 --> 12:53.140
Aha! Aha!

12:53.450 --> 12:56.910
Aha!
It's a Nanking Tamasudare!

12:57.160 --> 12:58.920
Just stretch it a little...

12:59.020 --> 13:00.650
Just stretch it a little...

13:00.760 --> 13:04.250
And now you have a weeping willow!

13:04.360 --> 13:07.400
And now you have a weeping willow!

13:04.930 --> 13:07.400
I think it's been ten minutes now...

13:07.670 --> 13:10.900
What in the world are
you doing, Principal?

13:11.000 --> 13:13.840
You must take our guests
to the classroom at once!

13:13.910 --> 13:14.770
But...

13:14.870 --> 13:16.400
No buts!

13:19.140 --> 13:20.240
What's it gonna be?

13:21.110 --> 13:21.740
Fine.

13:22.010 --> 13:22.570
Huh?

13:22.950 --> 13:24.810
I said it's fine by me.

13:25.180 --> 13:27.280
Meet me after school, at the river!

13:27.390 --> 13:28.320
Gotcha.

13:31.960 --> 13:33.520
Please, we must hurry.

13:33.660 --> 13:36.690
I'm sure that class
is already in session.

13:42.200 --> 13:43.760
Now then, please come inside!

13:44.340 --> 13:44.960
Huh?

13:45.340 --> 13:47.170
What?

13:47.270 --> 13:50.870
Solve the parabolic function when
the vertices are (2,3) and (3,4).

13:50.980 --> 13:52.310
B-But, when did they...

13:52.410 --> 13:55.750
The formula to determine the
parabolic function is: Y=A.

13:58.650 --> 14:01.680
Oh, my stars!
I feel so flustered!

14:01.790 --> 14:02.720
Sheesh.

14:06.160 --> 14:09.250
Well, thank goodness that's over.

14:10.260 --> 14:12.490
If you go one-on-one with me...

14:13.200 --> 14:14.960
Damn that little prick Sawada!

14:15.070 --> 14:16.830
What the hell is he trying to pull!

14:19.740 --> 14:22.710
Sawada, Sawada, Sawada...

14:22.870 --> 14:23.740
Mmm...

14:24.240 --> 14:26.070
Just as I thought, straight A's...

14:26.180 --> 14:29.170
I was Sawada' homeroom
teacher last year...

14:29.310 --> 14:31.370
His grades were exceptional.

14:31.520 --> 14:32.310
Really?

14:32.450 --> 14:34.040
I don't understand...

14:34.150 --> 14:36.520
...then why did he come to this school?

14:36.790 --> 14:41.390
Well, there was an incident
when he was in junior high...

14:41.630 --> 14:44.760
He beat up his homeroom teacher,
put him in the hospital.

14:47.670 --> 14:49.000
Why did he do that?

14:49.170 --> 14:50.070
Who knows?

14:50.540 --> 14:53.800
I really don't know where
he's coming from sometimes...

14:53.910 --> 14:56.770
...but he is very popular
among the students.

14:58.840 --> 15:00.840
What's up with the Sawada boy?

15:00.950 --> 15:02.110
Oh, nothing really.

15:02.680 --> 15:04.050
Ms. Yamaguchi...

15:04.180 --> 15:07.850
Speaking of Sawada, have you asked
him to join the choir club yet?

15:08.050 --> 15:08.650
Huh?

15:08.750 --> 15:10.720
You want me to ask him?

15:11.220 --> 15:13.820
Well, of course
I'll approach him myself...

15:13.990 --> 15:16.990
But a word from his
homeroom teacher would help.

15:17.130 --> 15:18.560
I really want Shin Sawada!

15:19.730 --> 15:21.530
Well, thanks in advance!

15:23.440 --> 15:24.960
Shin Sawada...

15:25.140 --> 15:27.630
There's more to him
than meets the eye...

15:35.880 --> 15:37.140
You think she'll show?

15:37.650 --> 15:39.310
I wouldn't bet on it.

15:39.520 --> 15:40.140
Damn right!

15:40.250 --> 15:43.150
No teacher would go
one-on-one with a student!

15:43.560 --> 15:48.650
I wonder why Shin's so fixated on
a lameass teacher like Yankumi?

15:48.830 --> 15:49.490
Who knows?

15:49.590 --> 15:52.860
But it looks like he's kinda
enjoying himself, don't you think?

15:52.960 --> 15:55.260
He even shows up for
class most of the time.

15:55.370 --> 15:59.670
I've known him since grade school,
but I've never seen him like this.

15:59.840 --> 16:02.670
Yeah, he's a cool dude isn't he?

16:03.010 --> 16:04.770
Yeah, he's kinda hot.

16:04.980 --> 16:06.040
Dumbasses!

16:06.280 --> 16:08.270
Don't make me puke, for chrissake!

16:08.380 --> 16:10.370
We've got other things to worry about!

16:10.480 --> 16:13.510
He hits another teacher,
there's gonna be hell to pay.

16:13.620 --> 16:14.550
He's got priors!

16:15.020 --> 16:17.820
But it's different this time.

16:18.320 --> 16:20.620
Last time, the teacher
really had it coming.

16:21.960 --> 16:23.950
He was such a sonofabitch...

16:24.160 --> 16:26.030
Ishizuka, enough of your lies!

16:26.130 --> 16:28.760
I know it was you who stole
the money from the donation box!

16:28.870 --> 16:31.130
I said it wasn't me! Monkey-face!

16:31.270 --> 16:33.400
You're the only one
who'd do such a thing.

16:33.640 --> 16:37.080
Until you come clean, I'm going to
make everyone stand during class.

16:37.180 --> 16:38.040
What?

16:38.940 --> 16:41.610
It's all because of you, Ishizuka.

16:41.710 --> 16:44.150
Goddammit, it wasn't me.

16:46.920 --> 16:48.850
Quit screwing around and start class.

16:48.990 --> 16:50.390
All we have to do is stand, right?

16:50.490 --> 16:51.250
Shin...

16:53.430 --> 16:57.490
The thief turned out to be
someone from the class next door.

16:57.930 --> 16:58.900
Apologize!

16:59.130 --> 17:01.190
Get down on your knees
and apologize to Ishizuka!

17:01.300 --> 17:04.030
He's always in trouble,
that's why he got fingered!

17:04.140 --> 17:05.100
What?

17:05.600 --> 17:07.040
He asked for it.

17:07.140 --> 17:11.980
A kid like Ishizuka is guilty
until proven innocent!

17:12.740 --> 17:13.910
You asshole!

17:18.780 --> 17:20.780
Try saying that again!

17:20.890 --> 17:22.150
Shin-chan!

17:22.850 --> 17:23.910
Help!

17:24.020 --> 17:27.550
He's going to kill me!
Somebody help me!

17:28.160 --> 17:31.430
They made a huge stink about it,
but it wasn't Shin-chan's fault.

17:31.530 --> 17:33.830
Jeez, what a shitbag of a teacher.

17:36.030 --> 17:38.200
Yankumi! When the hell did you...

17:38.570 --> 17:41.170
He's a decent guy who
takes care of his friends...

17:41.410 --> 17:42.770
Hey, are you an idiot?

17:42.870 --> 17:44.470
Why the hell did you show up?

17:44.580 --> 17:45.600
I had no choice.

17:45.740 --> 17:47.510
I have to keep my promise.

17:48.350 --> 17:49.680
Promise?

17:49.950 --> 17:52.420
Didn't you hear what we just said?

17:52.520 --> 17:53.180
Hey!

17:53.620 --> 17:55.550
What's her problem, anyway?

17:55.650 --> 17:57.920
You think Shin-chan's
gonna fight her for real?

18:05.230 --> 18:08.500
I thought I could count on
you to keep your promise.

18:09.330 --> 18:10.360
So?

18:11.070 --> 18:14.130
Like I said, take me on, one-on-one.

18:23.080 --> 18:24.810
Brrrr!

18:27.690 --> 18:28.920
Idiot!

18:30.960 --> 18:33.590
I know you want to go
one-on-one, but what for?

18:34.130 --> 18:37.690
I want to see for myself how
you beat up Kudoh and his gang.

18:37.900 --> 18:39.830
Why do you think I'm
the one who did that?

18:40.230 --> 18:43.500
From the start, I knew you weren't
just some ordinary teacher.

18:43.870 --> 18:46.340
You can really kick some ass, can't you?

18:48.740 --> 18:50.230
That's why...

18:51.910 --> 18:53.210
I have to see...

18:53.580 --> 18:54.270
Shin-chan!

18:54.380 --> 18:55.710
Don't tell me they're
really gonna fight?

18:56.410 --> 18:57.970
"You wanna see, you wanna see"...

18:58.220 --> 19:02.120
Is that your childish excuse for leading
the whole grade to boycott my class?

19:02.250 --> 19:02.950
What?

19:03.490 --> 19:05.960
Two things you did today
really pissed me off.

19:06.290 --> 19:08.950
First, you mobilized
your crew for no reason.

19:09.260 --> 19:10.190
My crew?

19:10.700 --> 19:14.190
Don't you dare move bodies for
your own selfish, petty reasons.

19:14.430 --> 19:17.600
Hey, they stopped moving,
what are they saying?

19:17.740 --> 19:19.200
No good, I can't hear anything.

19:19.340 --> 19:22.210
Second, you challenged me to go
one-on-one just for the hell of it.

19:22.340 --> 19:24.310
You were just grandstanding!

19:24.540 --> 19:26.140
I wasn't grandstanding!

19:26.280 --> 19:27.210
I'm dead serious.

19:27.480 --> 19:28.500
Oh, yeah?

19:28.810 --> 19:33.340
You mean you'd hit me for no better
reason than to satisfy your curiosity?

19:33.550 --> 19:35.450
But you're not that
kind of person, are you?

19:38.820 --> 19:39.620
All right, then!

19:39.790 --> 19:40.780
Listen up!

19:40.960 --> 19:44.120
When you fight, it's got to be
an all-out, life-or-death slugfest.

19:44.260 --> 19:46.230
Two men putting their lives on the line...

19:46.330 --> 19:48.730
...ill-fated to scatter in
a storm of cherry blossoms!

19:49.130 --> 19:50.760
What are you talking about?

19:51.570 --> 19:53.770
Uh, well, I mean...

19:54.310 --> 19:57.170
I'm not going one-on-one
with you, that's what.

19:57.540 --> 20:01.710
But a promise is a promise,
and I'm going make it up to you.

20:01.850 --> 20:03.820
What do you mean,
you're gonna fight me after all?

20:04.280 --> 20:05.840
Instead of fighting, look!

20:06.150 --> 20:07.740
You have energy to spare...

20:07.850 --> 20:11.310
Why not give yourself a viable
outlet by joining the choir club?

20:11.960 --> 20:15.320
I can pull some strings so you'll
get extra-special treatment...

20:15.490 --> 20:16.830
Choir club?

20:17.100 --> 20:19.590
That's right, a boys' choir club.

20:19.730 --> 20:21.320
And the advisor for
the boys' choir club is...

20:21.500 --> 20:22.630
She of the sexy body...

20:22.730 --> 20:24.430
Ms. Fujiyama!

20:26.040 --> 20:27.300
Are you messing with me?

20:27.440 --> 20:29.170
I'm gonna kick your teeth in, bitch!

20:32.080 --> 20:34.100
Hey, what's going on down there?

20:34.280 --> 20:35.610
It's the pigs!

20:38.180 --> 20:40.680
The pigs are here!
Five-oh! Crap!

20:40.790 --> 20:41.950
Hey, it's the pigs.

20:42.050 --> 20:43.040
I know.

20:43.560 --> 20:45.490
Who knew they'd be
on the scene so soon...

20:45.590 --> 20:46.560
Who tipped them off?

20:46.690 --> 20:47.560
Hey!

20:47.730 --> 20:49.390
Hold it, you two!

20:49.860 --> 20:51.300
This isn't good, we gotta haul ass!

20:51.400 --> 20:53.190
Split up and make a run for it, dammit!

20:54.400 --> 20:56.130
Shin-chan, it's the police.

20:56.230 --> 20:57.460
Hold it!

20:57.570 --> 20:59.500
We gotta get out of here!
We're screwed!

21:01.210 --> 21:02.270
Hold it!

21:02.370 --> 21:04.100
Halt!

21:08.210 --> 21:10.380
Hey, she's a teacher.

21:10.520 --> 21:12.710
Why's she so desperate
to give the cops the slip?

21:12.820 --> 21:13.750
How should I know?

21:13.890 --> 21:16.120
Not to mention she's so frickin' fast!

21:16.650 --> 21:18.780
Just as I thought
she's not just anybody.

21:18.890 --> 21:21.090
Come on, she's just a crazy teacher!

21:23.900 --> 21:25.060
Stop!

21:25.200 --> 21:27.500
Holy crap, Ojou!

21:27.870 --> 21:29.270
Hold it!

21:31.140 --> 21:32.500
Ouch!

21:36.140 --> 21:40.100
Hey, Guv'nor, put those
cuffs on me instead of Ojou.

21:40.450 --> 21:42.280
W-What?

21:46.950 --> 21:48.610
I know she's hiding something!

21:48.720 --> 21:50.420
I'm gonna find out what it is!

22:06.440 --> 22:16.440
<i>We are all born</i>
<i>crying out to the world.</i>

22:17.520 --> 22:27.410
<i>Because of all the endless grief</i>
<i>that we must go through in life.</i>

22:28.230 --> 22:38.160
<i>All of the heartache</i>
<i>is such a heavy load to bear.</i>

22:38.340 --> 22:48.340
<i>On those days when I am alone and cold</i>
<i>I'll light a fire with my own two hands.</i>

22:48.880 --> 22:58.880
<i>Treacherous mountains are my chosen path.</i>
<i>I'll move forward without a backward glance.</i>

23:17.040 --> 23:19.910
You want to go
one-on-one with Ojou?

23:20.010 --> 23:23.180
You're living in a dream world, kiddo.

23:23.520 --> 23:28.890
Ojou's not such a wuss that she'd let
some two-bit schmuck jerk her around!

23:29.020 --> 23:30.150
Get real!

23:30.490 --> 23:31.820
After-hours classes?

23:32.020 --> 23:33.360
His first time?

23:33.460 --> 23:34.820
No way...

23:34.990 --> 23:37.690
I really can't tell you more than that...

23:38.030 --> 23:41.060
Next episode, Kuma's First Time?

23:41.200 --> 23:44.400
Now there's a man!
